Template: bitcoin/rdts
Type: boolean
Description: Update and apply the BLAKE2b network upgrade?
 Important: BLAKE2b Network Upgrade
 .
 This version of Bitcoin Knots mitigates recent attacks on the Bitcoin network. By proceeding with this installation, you are explicitly adopting this upgrade.
 .
 For more information, see: https://bitcoinknots.org/learn/2026-blake2b
 .
 Important: Because this upgrade is already active on the network, skipping or delaying this package update does not reject it. Running outdated software after any network upgrade only leaves your node vulnerable to displaying fake or fraudulent transactions. Attacks of this nature already exist in the wild.
